# IINA permissions

Do not add `allowedDomains` or wildcard network hosts. Overlay baseline permission is
`video-overlay` only. Extra permissions (`network-request`, `file-system`, `show-osd`,
`show-alert`) require an explicit permission migration requested by the user, not a
check-pass workaround.
